    "finding": "The required strict live linkcheck passes on both PR and main. The PR run took about 69 seconds with one rate-limit wait; the main run took about 254 seconds with five, including repeated waits for an existing Microsoft GitHub link. CI performs one strict linkcheck per PR or main event; Docs Deploy is a separate HTML build. Caching, URL exclusions, fewer retries, or relaxed failure handling would weaken current acceptance. One worker was previously slower. The variability and Sphinx default-five-worker configuration justify a controlled two-worker trial while retaining all URLs, default retries/Retry-After, and strict warnings-as-errors.",
